<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 13.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   93/94    100/101    UNQ    171/174</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  96/98    102/104  178/180  188/190</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunkers held steady on Friday amid poor demand while MDO and gas oil continued their downtrend, traders said. While demand remains slack, some independents cut offers to get business but majors maintained their recent offers.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
